Subject: [PATCH 2/2] tests: ospfd max-lsa

A neighbor redistributes 120 statics against max-lsa 100: ignore, the
adjacency and the learned LSAs gone, back after ignore-time, isolated
after ignore-count, clear ip ospf max-lsa, warning-only, threshold and
no max-lsa.
